<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Application Update - Raven</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f7f6;
            color: #374151;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 35px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #e2ebe6;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .logo {
            text-align: center;
            color: #007a55;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #101b18;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .reason {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            background: #fdf2f2;
            border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: #611a15;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5eee9;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9aaa9f;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="logo">
            RAVEN
        </div>

        <h2>Application Update</h2>

        <p>
            Hello <%= name %>,
        </p>

        <p>
            Thank you for your interest in joining
            <strong>Raven</strong> as a developer.
        </p>

        <p>
            After carefully reviewing your application, we're unable
            to approve your application at this time.
        </p>

        <% if (reason) { %>
            <div class="reason">
                <strong>Reason:</strong>
                <%= reason %>
            </div>
            <% } %>

                <p>
                    We appreciate the time and effort you put into your application
                    and encourage you to continue developing your skills and experience.
                </p>

                <div class="footer">
                    &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Raven. All rights reserved.
                        <br />
                        See what's next. Build what matters.
                </div>

    </div>

</body>

</html>